    "site_desc": "The tower was located in feild formerly planted with annual crops. The tower was in place prior to and during part of the contsruction of a solar PV Array at the site. During the time that the tower was in place, the feild was bare or planted with a cover crop. The site is located on a south-facing slope, at the bottom of which is a stream. Crop feilds are located to the north, east and west of the tower site.",
